CAN A 1-MINUTE STRATEGY PAY FOR ITSELF?
30 days of 1m candles · live order book · 2026-09-12

Riptide's 30m median stop is 1.45% and it pays 47% of gross to
fees. 15m at 1.01% is NET NEGATIVE. This asks what 1m stops
look like and what that ratio becomes.

  fetched BTC_USDT          43200 bars  1m ATR 0.044%  spread 0.000%  taker 0.020%
  fetched ZEC_USDT          43200 bars  1m ATR 0.176%  spread 0.001%  taker 0.000%
  fetched LSK_USDT          43200 bars  1m ATR 0.098%  spread 0.012%  taker 0.020%
  fetched BEAT_USDT         43200 bars  1m ATR 0.363%  spread 0.110%  taker 0.000%
  fetched PONS_USDT         43200 bars  1m ATR 0.559%  spread 0.033%  taker 0.000%
  fetched BTW_USDT          43200 bars  1m ATR 0.279%  spread 0.032%  taker 0.000%
  fetched VIRTUAL_USDT      43200 bars  1m ATR 0.124%  spread 0.016%  taker 0.000%

