THE COMPARISON THAT MATTERS
================================================================================================
  strategy                        stop %    cost %   cost in R      
  Riptide 30m (measured)          1.450%    0.016%        0.01
  Riptide 15m (NET NEGATIVE)      1.010%    0.016%        0.02
  1m @ 2x ATR                     0.352%    0.016%        0.05
  1m @ 3x ATR                     0.528%    0.016%        0.03

  Median across the sampled symbols. If the 1m rows sit far
  above the 15m row — the one already measured as losing —
  then the branch needs a bigger stop, which is a slower
  timeframe wearing a 1m label.
